AUD:E_0131{event:"E-0131", evidence:"Root cause was NOT an arqux bug: the tool venv had codec-cortex 0.4.0 (PyPI) whose validator rejected $0.1 (arqux BLP-041 ARQX:artifact metadata) with E017_UNPARSED_LINE / E033_ZERO_SECTION_MEMORY_ENTRY. Installing codec-cortex 0.5.2 (uv pip install --python /home/vatrox/.local/share/uv/tools/arqux/bin/python3 codec-cortex==0.5.2) updated the validator to a version that supports the BLP-041 schema. All 50 tests in test_template_validation.py now pass; full suite 867 passed / 0 failed. No arqux source change required. Design decision from prior message is moot.", task:"T-002", kind:"task_complete", agent:"alfred", result:"Root cause was NOT an arqux bug: the tool venv had codec-cortex 0.4.0 (PyPI) whose validator rejected $0.1 (arqux BLP-041 ARQX:artifact metadata) with E017_UNPARSED_LINE / E033_ZERO_SECTION_MEMORY_ENTRY. Installing codec-cortex 0.5.2 (uv pip install --python /home/vatrox/.local/share/uv/tools/arqux/bin/python3 codec-cortex==0.5.2) updated the validator to a version that supports the BLP-041 schema. All 50 tests in test_template_validation.py now pass; full suite 867 passed / 0 failed. No arqux source change required. Design decision from prior message is moot.", date:"2026-07-19"}

